  "name": "Shield Transference",
  "type": "ability",
  "img": "icons/svg/book.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Choose an ally within 5ft of you when you initiate this. When you do, choose one type of Defense they possess: MD, TD, or PD. Reduce that Defense by half your Fate, rounded up for as long as you maintain Focus (the chosen defense can drop below the target’s AD through this effect). Choose a different Defense from: MD, TD, or PD. Increase that Defense by half your Fate, rounded up. Every turn you maintain Focus on Shield Transference, you can only renew Focus when you are within 5ft of that ally.</p>",
